## Hellenides region hosts 4 karst springs from 2 different countries.

Albanian karst spring discharge data is provided by Romeo Eftimi (eftimiromeo@gmail.com)
Greek karst spring discharge data is provided by Bruno Arfib (arfib@cerege.fr) and Eleni Zagana (zagana@upatras.gr).

For further information, please see Metadata table.
